.snes
; escbank.pasm — SA-1 "escape bank": native escapes too big for bank-$00 gaps. Runs at $92:8000
; (file $290000, Sa1.cpp $80-$9F:8000 -> prgRom seg 2). The leading `.snes` is REQUIRED (sets the
; target in source so Poppy's analyzer tracks rep/sep — else 16-bit immediates mis-size and forward
; branches break). Escapes return `jml.l inext`, call bank-$00 helpers via `jsl.l <h>_l` rtl-wrappers
; (interp.pasm). Bank-$00 symbol constants below: auto-generated by tools/gen_escbank_syms.py.
;
; LAYOUT: a jmp jump-table at $8000 so the interp dispatcher only needs a fixed slot address
; (`jml $928000 + slot*3`), never an escape's actual address. Add an escape: append a `jmp entry_X`
; table slot, append the entry_X body, and add a dispatcher `jml $92<slot*3>` in interp.pasm.

; >>> ESCBANK_SYMS — auto-generated by tools/gen_escbank_syms.py (do not edit) <<<
inext=$00D128
rdw40_l=$00E59E
wrw40_l=$00E5A2
